---
description: TypeScript conventions for this project
globs: **/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

- Use `type` (not `interface`) for type definitions.
- Use `import type` for type-only imports.
- PascalCase for type names; prefix unused vars with `_`.
- Import order: builtin > external > internal > parent > sibling > index.
- Alphabetize within groups; newline between groups; `react` first among externals.
- No unused imports.
